Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This film's producer wasn't a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:04.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was five lakh Gujarati
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,farmers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:07.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the story of Anand's milk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,cooperatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:09.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the man behind them, Dr
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Verghese Kurien.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:12.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kurien and Shyam Benegal wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,it on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,But who would pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The answer: ₹2 from every member
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.31,0:00:20.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five lakh farmers. ₹10 lakh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:22.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why the film opens with:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,'500,000 farmers of Gujarat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:25.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,present'.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:28.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Farmers came by the truckload to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,see their film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:31.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in 2024, Manthan reached
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cannes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,India's first crowdfunded film,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:35.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,by Gujarat's farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:37.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you sending this to?
